<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $107 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $107 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Wednesday it placed $107 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight call money rose to 6.45 percent from 6.38 percent Tuesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was flat at 0.99985 pesos.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
</text>
